        <register>
          <name>SUBBLK_CLOCK_CR</name>
          <description>Enables the clock to the MSS peripheral. By turning clocks off dynamic power can be saved. When the clock is off the peripheral should not be accessed, the acess may be ignored, return unspecified data or result in bus response error.</description>
