 1 - enabled
 0 - masked</description>
              <bitRange>[18:18]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>ECCRC_SE</name>
              <description>ECCRC_SE - Command CRC Error Status Enable (SD mode only)

 1 - enabled
 0 - masked</description>
              <bitRange>[17:17]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>ECT_SE</name>
              <description>ECT_SE - Command Timeout Error Status Enable (SD mode only)

 1 - enabled
 0 - masked</description>
              <bitRange>[16:16]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>CQINT_SE</name>
              <description>CQINT_SE - Command Queuing Status Enable

 1 - enabled
