              <description>Set to indicate configuration with DDR4 RDIMMs that have four ranks that encode chip-select down to 3 bits. When this port is set to '1', sd_cs_n[2:0] will only be used to designate rank selection to the RCD device. Refer to the JEDEC DDR4RCD01 DDR4 Registering Clock Driver (RCD) specification for details on how the Encoded Quad CS is used in an RDIMM application.</description>
              <bitRange>[0:0]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
          </fields>
        </register>
