              <description>Time in LPI. This register increments once every 16 pclk cycles when the LPI indication bit 7 is set in the network status register. Cleared on read.</description>
              <bitRange>[23:0]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
          </fields>
        </register>
